  "boundary": "This is retrospective attribution of preselected V17 short-distance Firecloud edges within the SAME historical public100, not a new heldout activation predictor. The official conventional Chunnel minimum is 100LY, reduced to 1LY under Short Format Cyborg Stabilization Field or within a Dungeon Class Stargate field (engine-dependent range 150..550LY). Tminus1 game settings might omit the rule flag, and ship hull108 plus spatial range alone cannot establish field activation at the later Host phase; other owners/turn-phases can matter. Only explicit safe scalar settings are retained; NO player secrets, names, raw FC codes or free-text settings. A missing indicator is ABSTAIN, not evidence the ability was disabled. One short edge ending at a far target is not proof of a short Chunnel. Original V17 actor T statuses only checked after all Tminus1 features freeze. No future VCR or canonical movement/combat promotion.",
